# OpenAI / ChatGPT Surge external ruleset
# Policy is assigned by the importing RULE-SET line.
#
# Verified: 2026-10-09
# - https://hello-web-demo-sep30.winx402.chatgpt.site returned the OpenAI /
#   ChatGPT sign-in page (HTTP 401); its response cookie is scoped to
#   .chatgpt.site.  DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.site covers this site and future
#   ChatGPT Sites under the same suffix.
# - auth.openai.com and platform.openai.com resolve to Cloudflare endpoints;
#   they are covered by DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openai.com.
# - ChatGPT web, static resources, and generated-user-content domains are
#   covered by the remaining suffix rules below.
#
# Source references:
# - https://help.openai.com/
# - https://platform.openai.com/docs/

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.site
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openai.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaiusercontent.com
